@startuml
title Sequence Diagram 3: Attendee Registers for an Event (F3)
autonumber
actor "Attendee" as P0
participant "React UI" as P1
participant "Registration API" as P2
participant "Registration Service" as P3
participant "Database" as P4
participant "Notification Service" as P5
P0 -> P1 : Click Register
P1 -> P2 : POST /api/events/:id/registrations
P2 -> P3 : register(eventId, attendeeId)
P3 -> P4 : BEGIN and lock the event row
P3 -> P4 : Check status, start time, duplicate
P4 --> P3 : Check results
alt event open and not already registered
P3 -> P4 : Count confirmed registrations
alt confirmed less than capacity
P3 -> P4 : Insert CONFIRMED with ticket ID
else event is full
P3 -> P4 : Insert WAITLISTED with position
end
P3 -> P4 : COMMIT
P3 -> P5 : Send confirmation or waitlist notice
P2 --> P1 : 201 {status, ticketId or position}
P1 --> P0 : Show confirmation
else closed, started or duplicate
P3 -> P4 : ROLLBACK
P2 --> P1 : 400 Not open / 409 Already registered
end
@enduml
